              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uku ni k’Uhoraho agize, ati Ni mwitondere ibiroranye, mukore ivy’ ukugororoka: kukw agakiza kanje kagira gashike, n’ ukugororoka kwanje kugira guhishurwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.58.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 58:13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hahirwa umuntu akora ivyo, n’umwana w’umuntu abibangiriza, akaziririza isabato ntayikēngēre, akarinda ukuboko kwiwe ntigukore icaha na kimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.14.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 14:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ umunyamahanga yifatanije n’Uhoraho yoye kuvuga, at’ Uhoraho ntazobura kuntandukanya n’abantu biwe; canke n’inkone yoye kuvuga, it’ Erega nd’ igiti cumye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuk’ ukw ari k’ Uhoraho agize ku vy’inkone ziziririza amasabato yiwe, zigahitamw’ ibimunezereza, zikabangiriza isezerano ryiwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.18.18"
