              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbere n’imbga z’ ibigunya, zitigera zihāga; kand’ abo bameze bartyo n’abungere! Nta co bashobora gutahura; bose bījaniye inzira zabo ubgabo, umuntu wese yironderera inyungu impande zose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.11"
            ]
